 'Breaking off of the desolate trail, you enter a dark crevice. Beneath you, the crevice opens deeper into the ground, into darkness. Ancient rock surrounds you on other sides, but it seems possible to descend safely down the crevice.'),
(24601, 'Under the Crevice',
 'You find yourself in a wide maw within the earth. Patches of sky can still be seen from this point, should one gaze upward. However, this is not recommended since the terrain is treacherous and treading should be done with the utmost care. The terrain looks particularly slippery on the ravine leading down. Looking around you, you notice nothing but foreboding darkness.'),
(24602, 'Under the Crevice',
 'A rare patch of brighter darkness pierces the darkness all around you. After a moment of confusion, you realize this is the light that still comes in this place from the world outside. The atmosphere of the rift is oppresive and dank, heralding what lays ahead, should you venture deeper into the caves.'),
(24603, 'Under the Crevice',
 'A rare patch of brighter darkness pierces the darkness all around you. After a moment of confusion, you realize this is the light that still comes in this place from the world outside. The atmosphere of the rift is oppresive and dank, heralding what lays ahead, should you venture deeper into the caves.'),
(24604, 'Pile of Rubble',
 'Jagged rocks fill this cold cave. Aeons have worked their course, forming impossibly sharp and long stalagmites on the cave floor. The cave is cold, and judging by the bones lying scattered among the rocks, many a creature had met its demize here. Fortunately for you, the fall had merely stunned you. You begin contemplating on your way back.'),
(24605, 'A Rough-Hewn Cavern Trail',
 'The trail ends abruptly here, at the base of a steep rise leading upwards to the surface world. Generations of Goblin miners have formed a haphazard trail, whose primary purpose is to carry the crystal from the depths of their mines to the dwellers under the skies. The trails extends northwards into the warm darkness, the pebbles ground into the dust beneath your feet.'),
(24606, 'A Rough-Hewn Cavern Trail',
 'The trail ends abruptly here, at the base of a steep rise leading upwards to the surface world. Generations of Goblin miners have formed a haphazard trail, whose primary purpose is to carry the crystal from the depths of their mines to the dwellers under the skies. The trail extends northwards into the warm darkness, the pebbles ground into the dust beneath your feet.'),
(24607, 'At The Turn In The Trail',
 'The trail is bent at an angle at this point, carved through the less resistant rock. It appears that a large block of iron oxide had blocked the natural path and not even the stalwart goblin miners could dig through it. The path leads further towards the centre of the caves to the west, or towards the surface world, to the south.'),
(24608, 'The Intersection of the Trails',
 'Trails leading eastward and westward meet at this cavern. Somewhat spacious, it is connecting the trails with the main complex of caves lying to the north. Seeing more traffic than either of the two trails, this section looks considerably cleaner as well.'),
(24609, 'At The Turn In The Trail',
 'The trail is bent at an angle at this point, carved through the less resistant rock. It appears that a large block of iron oxide had blocked the natural path and not even the stalwart goblin miners could dig through it. The path leads further towards the centre of the caves to the east, or towards the surface world, to the south.'),
(24610, 'Before the Massive Stone Gate',
 'Huge bile of rock meets here, forming a natural chasm. Between walls ridden with minerals, goblins had built a massive protective stone gate. Carved from the most resilient of stone, it divides the inner goblin caves from the rest of the world. In the days long gone, it may have served a defensive purpose, but nowadays, goblins leave it open as it lays on the trade route. Several torches are placed to the either side of the gate, so as to allow more adventurous surface dwellers to prepare to brave the depths lying north with greater ease.'),
(24611, 'At the Beginning of a Cavern',
 'The first contact with the goblin kingdom makes you realize that these caves are not a mere mine excavation expoited by savages. There seems to be some sort of a pattern to the myriad of routes that goblin have created and utilized. The fervour of the creatures and the buzz of work and conversation flows through the air from all around you.'),
(24612, 'In the Shades',
 'The darker shadows this place is immersed in seem unnatural. So close to the busy, massive stone gate, yet few goblins roam here. The darkness is augmented by the absence of the torches, which adorn the gate.'),
(24613, 'In the Shades',
 'The darker shadows this place is immersed in seem unnatural. So close to the busy, massive stone gate, yet few goblins roam here. The darkness is augmented by the absence of the torches, which adorn the gate.'),
(24614, 'An Expansive Cavern',
 'Sheer magnitude of this cave speaks volumes of the effort put in by generations of Goblins working the earth. Ceiling is lost at over 100 feet of height and echoes of incessant Goblin chatter are multiplied under it. At either side of you, there is nothing but massive emptiness, telling you that the cave expands further on.'),
(24615, 'An Expansive Cavern',
 'Sheer magnitude of this cave speaks volumes of the effort put in by generations of Goblins working the earth. Ceiling is lost at over 100 feet of height and echoes of incessant Goblin chatter are multiplied under it. At either side of you, there is nothing but massive emptiness, telling you that the cave expands further on.'),
(24616, 'An Expansive Cavern',
 'Sheer magnitude of this cave speaks volumes of the effort put in by generations of Goblins working the earth. Ceiling is lost at over 100 feet of height and echoes of incessant Goblin chatter are multiplied under it. At either side of you, there is nothing but massive emptiness, telling you that the cave expands further on.'),
(24617, 'The Spacious Cave',
 'The true beginning of the rough miners'' cave system, this spacious cave has walls that have recent scars embedded in them, along with the ancient ones. It seems that miners make it a habit to chip at the wall as they pass on north-east deeper into the caves. Quite possibly, this is for good luck. The draft of breeze cools your face from the south, and you realize that huge expanse of a cave lies in that direction.'),
(24618, 'The Spacious Cave',
 'The true beginning of the rough miners'' cave system, this spacious cave has walls that have recent scars embedded in them, along with the ancient ones. It seems that miners make it a habit to chip at the wall as they pass on north-east deeper into the caves. Quite possibly, this is for good luck. The draft of breeze cools your face from the south, and you realize that huge expanse of a cave lies in that direction.'),
(24619, 'The Spacious Cave',
 'The true beginning of the rough miners'' cave system, this spacious cave has walls that have recent scars embedded in them, along with the ancient ones. It seems that miners make it a habit to chip at the wall as they pass on north-east deeper into the caves. Quite possibly, this is for good luck. The draft of breeze cools your face from the south, and you realize that huge expanse of a cave lies in that direction. Another air stream caresses your skin from the opposite direction. The path north leads further into the mines.'),
(24620, 'Along the Western Wall of An Expansive Cavern',
 'The cave finally ends here, and this only because of the impenetrable rock that forms its western wall. The seam between the ceiling swooping from the dizzying heights and the wall is not artificial, but the work of nature. It seems that the goblins have realized that this rock they cannot conquer and they had simply made the most of it. The chatter of the workplace seems a bit less loud here.'),
(24621, 'Along the Eastern Wall of An Expansive Cavern',
 'The cave finally ends here, and this only because of the impenetrable rock that forms its eastern wall. The seam between the ceiling swooping from the dizzying heights and the wall is not artificial, but the work of nature. It seems that the goblins have realized that this rock they cannot conquer and they had simply made the most of it. The chatter of the workplace seems a bit less loud here. The air seems cooler here and there are some small holes in the eastern wall.'),
(24622, 'The Corner of the Spacious Cave',
 'The true beginning of the rough miners'' cave system, this spacious cave has walls that have recent scars embedded in them, along with the ancient ones. It seems that miners make it a habit to chip at the wall as they move deeper into the caves. Quite possibly, this is for good luck. A slab of rock with fewer than usual chips attracts your attention. The oppresive walls encircle you to the north and west, forcing you to move east or south.'),
(24623, 'The Corner of the Spacious Cave',
 'The true beginning of the rough miners'' cave system, this spacious cave has walls that have recent scars embedded in them, along with the ancient ones. It seems that miners make it a habit to chip at the wall as they pass on north-east deeper into the caves. Quite possibly, this is for good luck. The draft of breeze cools your face from the south, and you realize that huge expanse of a cave lies in that direction. The oppressive walls encircle you north and east, cutting you off.'),
(24624, 'Beginning of a Dark, Busy Hallway',
 'This is hallway is one of the first mining sites in this complex. Signs of busy activity are all around you: shouts of miners as they call each other, singing of pickaxes as they strike in unison and an occasional curse. The rock through which the hallway has been carved is rich in crystal, with biles glimmering against the light. Thick, stout wooden beams support the cave ceiling safely.'),
(24625, 'In a Dark, Busy Hallway',
 'The hallway rich with crystal bile is perpetually busy. As one shift of miners leaves, the other one instantly takes their place. The walls of the hallway are heavily chipped, as pickaxes and hammers constantly batter them, in search of more crystal. Thick, stout supporting wooden beams look stable, as they support a low ceiling.'),
(24626, 'In a Dark, Busy Hallway',
 'The hallway rich with crystal bile is perpetually busy. As one shift of miners leaves, the other one instantly takes their place. The walls of the hallway are heavily chipped, as pickaxes and hammers constantly batter them, in search of more crystal. Thick, stout supporting wooden beams look stable, as they support a low ceiling.'),
(24627, 'The End of Dark, Busy Hallway',
 'This is the end of the central hallway that leads through the mines. The reason the miners had stopped here is the thinning of the crystal biles. Apparently, natural formation of softer rocks gave way to granite here and the bile had moved elsewhere. A well-beaten path leads towards the more civilized section of mines leads south. Deeper into the mines, a steep slope leads down.'),
(24628, 'At the Top of a Desolated Ravine',
 'The air in this corridor is dank and oppresive. Humidity lingers around you in the form of mist, carrying heavy scent from the pits beneath you. You could swear you hear restless rustling of leaves coming from the same direction. Your attention is captivated by an unnaturally smooth stone wall.'),
(24629, 'In the Middle of Rancid Clearing',
 'An unexpected sight greets you: impossible combination of rusted, ancient armour, bones of various creatures and what appears to be rotting, dead plants lay scattered about. The smell of decay is so strong that you feel momentarily overwhelmed and pause to rest. The way out of this insanity leads up the steep cliff, while all around you the rustling grows louder... Anxious, it would seem.'),
(24630, 'In the Pungent, Rough Corridor',
 'The scattered debris had spilled over from the central room to the east here. Not even a tight corridor had kept it at bay. The corridor itself is clearly not a work of any mortal hand. Erratic in its flow, its shadows are deceptive and unnatural.'),
(24631, 'In the Pungent, Rough Corridor',
 'The scattered debris had spilled over from the central room to the west here. Not even a tight corridor had kept it at bay. The corridor itself is clearly not a work of any mortal hand. Erratic in its flow, its shadows are deceptive and unnatural.'),
(24632, 'In the Pungent, Rough Corridor',
 'The scattered debris had spilled over from the central room to the south here. Not even a tight corridor had kept it at bay. The corridor itself is clearly not a work of any mortal hand. Erratic in its flow, its shadows are deceptive and unnatural. The temperature within this corridor is considerably higher than in the rest of the caves. You begin to sweat.'),
(24633, 'In the Pungent, Rough Corridor',
 'The scattered debris had spilled over from the central room to the north here. Not even a tight corridor had kept it at bay. The corridor itself is clearly not a work of any mortal hand. Erratic in its flow, its shadows are deceptive and unnatural.'),
(24634, 'In the Western Forgotten Caven',
 'A surprisingly small chamber unravels before you. The ceiling lays low, with the walls oppressively propelling it. The floor is uneven, covered in scattered debris, small rocks and an occasional bone protruding upwards. The air is dank, stale and perpetually caressed by a sweet, smelly musk.'),
(24635, 'North End of Western Forgotten Cave',
 'A surprisingly small chamber unravels before you. The ceiling lays low, with the walls oppressively propelling it. The floor is uneven, covered in scattered debris, small rocks and an occasional bone protruding upwards. The air is dank, stale and perpetually caressed by a sweet, smelly musk.'),
(24636, 'South End of Western Forgotten Cave',
 'A surprisingly small chamber unravels before you. The ceiling lays low, with the walls oppressively propelling it. The floor is uneven, covered in scattered debris, small rocks and an occasional bone protruding upwards. The air is dank, stale and perpetually caressed by a sweet, smelly musk.'),
(24637, 'In the Northern Forgotten Cave',
 'The warm phosphorous glow illuminates these small caverns. It seems that the glow comes from the plants themselves, as you are deeply entrenched within earth. However, although the glow is warm, the shadows it casts over pitch-black granite are menacing.'),
(24638, 'West End of Northern Forgotten Cave',
 'The warm phosphorous glow illuminates these small caverns. It seems that the glow comes from the plants themselves, as you are deeply entrenched within earth. However, although the glow is warm, the shadows it casts over pitch-black granite are menacing.'),
(24639, 'East End of Northern Forgotten Cave',
 'The warm phosphorous glow illuminates these small caverns. It seems that the glow comes from the plants themselves, as you are deeply entrenched within earth. However, although the glow is warm, the shadows it casts over pitch-black granite are menacing.'),
(24640, 'In the Southern Forgotten Cave',
 'Chillingly cold, the air in this cavern system forces you to puff out small clouds from your lungs. It seems that the plants here have rather peculiar metabolism, that forces them to release frost into their environment. The white coating all around walls, floor and ceiling is a thin layer of solid ice, glazed over pure white marble.'),
(24641, 'West End of Southern Forgotten Cave',
 'Chillingly cold, the air in this cavern system forces you to puff out small clouds from your lungs. It seems that the plants here have rather peculiar metabolism, that forces them to release frost into their environment. The white coating all around walls, floor and ceiling is a thin layer of solid ice, glazed over pure white marble.'),
(24642, 'East End of Northern Forgotten Cave',
 'Chillingly cold, the air in this cavern system forces you to puff out small clouds from your lungs. It seems that the plants here have rather peculiar metabolism, that forces them to release frost into their environment. The white coating all around walls, floor and ceiling is a thin layer of solid ice, glazed over pure white marble.'),
(24643, 'In the Eastern Forgotten Cave',
 'You find yourself in the lair of gargantuan proportions, inhabited by thin, agile plants. The walls, if there are any, are covered in thick lime-coloured slime -- no doubt, a vile excretion of the plants themselves. The source of the scent that was ever so pervasive throughout this Gods forsaken complex of caves is finally before your eyes: the rotting, pulsing and flailing arms of the plants themselves.'),
(24644, 'North End of Eastern Forgotten Cave',
 'You find yourself in the lair of gargantuan proportions, inhabited by thin, agile plants. The walls, if there are any, are covered in thick lime-coloured slime -- no doubt, a vile excretion of the plants themselves. The source of the scent that was ever so pervasive throughout this Gods forsaken complex of caves is finally before your eyes: the rotting, pulsing and flailing arms of the plants themselves.'),
