(24649, 'A Busy Intersection',
 'The steep ravine before you leads up, to the common area of the mines. All around you, there is nothing but darkness. Although you cannot feel the walls around you, you still feel entrapped. This is due to the low ceiling and the fact that in deep caves, such as there, there is no wind and the air is dank and stale. All around you, you hear busy chatter of a mine production in full swing.'),
(24650, 'North of the Busy Intersection',
 'Rough rock with jagged edges surrounds you. Crystal bile can be seen embedded in it, and the miners are busily digging away, amassing their wealth. Fine layer of dust lingers all throughout these caves, as specks of dust cannot escape on any wind. All around you, the sound of many pick-axes can be heard.'),
(24651, 'A Dead End of a Mine-Shaft',
 'The crystal bile exhausted, this section of the mine had been shut off. Only dark walls of soft rock, grazed by numerous empty channals bear witness to one-time expansion of the mines. The rock walls encircle you entirely and the only way to leave this particular casement is the same way you walked in.'),
(24652, 'Within a Dusty Mine-Shaft',
