(24689, 'In the New Casement',
 'This particular casement within the rock has just recently been opened. Dark grey rock is speckled with the crystal throughout. It seems that every swing of a pick-axe would bring one a hefty amount of coins. The miners who work here certainly agree, as they furiously work on the site, bent over under the low ceiling.'),
(24690, 'A Dry Tunnel',
 'This tunnel has seen better days: some time ago, while there was enough crystal to attract the scores of best miners, this sector of caves was bursting with activity. Nowadays, second-tier miners have taken over, scraping the remains, while the best of the miners had moved to the western complex of caves.'),
(24691, 'A Turn in the Dry Tunnel',
 'This tunnel has seen better days: some time ago, while there was enough crystal to attract the scores of best miners, this sector of caves was bursting with activity. Nowadays, second-tier miners have taken over, scraping the remains, while the best of the miners had moved to the western complex of caves. The tunnel wiggles around the rock, passing it to the north and west.'),
(24692, 'A Dry Tunnel',
 'This tunnel has seen better days: some time ago, while there was enough crystal to attract the scores of best miners, this sector of caves was bursting with activity. Nowadays, second-tier miners have taken over, scraping the remains, while the best of the miners had moved to the western complex of caves.'),
(24693, 'The End of a Dry Tunnel',
 'The tunnel comes to an end here. There is no crystal to be seen at all, yet the tunnel is in good shape. Even the debris that can be spotted everywhere where miners are involved is not present here. It seems as if some care was taken to keep this tunnel in good shape. You notice footsteps in the dust in front of you.'),
(24694, 'At the Entrance of the Crude Stronghold',
 'Natural underground cliffs block your passage to the east and west. Abrupt wall rises in front of you, blocking the path to the north. It seems that it is partially natural, though you can clearly spot unsophisticated, rough fortifications that were built atop the ridge. In the centre of the northern wall stands iron portcullis, barring the entrance beyond.'),
(24695, 'Inside an Old, Exploited Excavation',
 'Piles of debris and broken mining equipment are strewn across the uneven floor of this excavation. Where once there was a plethora of crystal, now only little veins remain. Just as the excavation has lost its glamour, so did the miners that work it now: old and sturdy, they none the less lack the strength of the younger miners.'),
(24696, 'Inside an Old, Exploited Excavation',
 'Piles of debris and broken mining equipment are strewn across the uneven floor of this excavation. Where once there was a plethora of crystal, now only little veins remain. Just as the excavation has lost its glamour, so did the miners that work it now: old and sturdy, they none the less lack the strength of the younger miners.'),
