(24741, 'Under the Raised Hut',
 'The distinguishing feature of this locale is the hut that raises above the flat, natural floor of the stronghold. The hut is obscured by the darkness, the only clearly visible part of it being numerous strong stone pillars that support it. A rough and primitive stone ladder has been carved into one of the pillars.'),
