(24763, 'At the Entrance of the Raised Hut',
 'The true magnitude of the hut is revealed only here. Massive walls are decorated with what must be the only traces of Art within the goblin tribes miles around. The pictures are crude and they portray the horde of goblins devouring another, smaller group of goblins. The wall ornament is interrupted by gaping door. Further through the door, the stench of goblin is strong.'),
